    {
      "component_id": "c_054",
      "class": "android.support.v7.widget.AppCompatTextView",
      "text": "DON'T buy your Chevy from Putnam. After wasted hours, they tried to trick us to sign a deal with the rebate fund I should be getting from Chevrolet for first time GM buyer and forfeiting the 60 Days GM Satisfaction program and called it their \"discounted price\"! What they called is a discounted price is just a lying game they played without integrity. Especially, the Sales Manager Michael Ng, he was just shifting numbers around and said they have provided discount, when clearly the price has not changed from MSRP. They are like the 70's car salesmen, think their customer is stupid. Don't let them fool you, just buy somewhere.",
      "content_desc": "",
